<title>USA: Dayton Superior names Khilnani CFO.</title>
<headline>Dayton Superior names Khilnani CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMISBURG, Ohio 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dayton Superior Corp said Thursday Vinod M. Khilnani has joined the company as Chief Financial Officer.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available to say who he succeeded.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Dayton Superior, Khilnani was employed for 18 years by Cummins Engine Co Inc, most recently as Executive Director-Treasury and Investment Evaluation, where he was responsible for Treasury Operations and coordination of all of Cummins' acquisitions and divestitures worldwide.  He was also serving as Acting Treasurer.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
